OL,3,GNEWSA'We hope Dolly would've approved
OL,4,Aof our announcement'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe director of Dolly Parton's musical
OL,7,Fsaid he hoped the country singer would
OL,8,Fhave been proud of the way the cast
OL,9,Fannounced her death to a live audience.
OL,11,FThe cast of 9 to 5 The Musical was
OL,12,Fmoments away from going on stage in
OL,13,FWorthing, West Sussex, when they
OL,14,Flearned of Parton's death on Tuesday.
OL,16,FBefore the start of the performance,
OL,17,Fsome of the audience gasped as cast
OL,18,Fmember Karla Tracey paid tribute to the
OL,19,F80-year-old's "extraordinary talent,
OL,20,Fcreativity, and spirit".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
